      "id": "claim_d5e17f0a4db84690bce7a57930a4a2e7",
      "statement": "ClientMessage is a protobuf oneof envelope with three variants: send_offer_message (answer_peer_id, offer_sdp), send_answer_message (offer_peer_id, answer_sdp), and send_ice_candidate_message (peer_id, candidate, relayed to the target peer for trickle ICE). The former update_peer_metadata_message variant has been removed from the wire format.",
