    {
      "id": "claim_cd9255bb1caf4d07ac07cf885713f8d2",
      "statement": "The server hub routes a client SendOfferMessage to the named answer peer and a SendAnswerMessage to the named offer peer; the server relays SDP verbatim without inspecting its content.",
